EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Wow! Is that YOU, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I somehow knew I'd bump into you
again! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}It's been a long time!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Anda, si eres tú, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Sabía que algún día te volvería
a ver!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ¿Cómo va todo?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Vay! SEN misin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yine karşılaşacağımızı nedense biliyordum!
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ne kadar zaman oldu!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ohmigosh! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}My wish was granted! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I was thinking how much I missed
you. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}And here you ARE, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aman tanrım! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Dileğim kabul oldu! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seni ne kadar özlediğimi düşünüyordum. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ve işte
BURADASIN, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}What?! Is that you, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I'm so happy to see you again! It's
like this is a dream or something!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Je rêve ? C'est toi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}C'est trop génial de se retrouver
comme ça, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Che?! Sei davvero tu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sono troppo contenta di rivederti!
Cioè, dico, mi sembra un sogno!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ne?! Sen misin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Seni yeniden gördüğüme o kadar sevindim ki!
Burası rüya falan gibi!
